  <item>
    <title>👂6. 从特朗普遇刺浅八世界著名刺杀事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669bcd7b8fcadceb90b5710f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669bcd7b8fcadceb90b5710f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 20 Jul 2024 14:45:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目热干面老师和胡辣汤老师从特朗普被刺，浅八了下世界各国著名的刺杀事件，美国有安德鲁·杰克逊、林肯、里根、肯尼迪等知名总统政要被刺，印度有总理甘地以及他儿子拉吉夫甘地遇刺事件，一战也是由一场刺杀引发。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对比中西方，中国古代历史中刺客的形象多带有侠义色彩，西方却很难找出一个正面的刺客形象。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>此川普非彼川普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>总统是一个高危职业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="614">10:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>肯尼迪总统被刺谜团</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1011">16:51</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>总统被刺的奇葩原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>印度甘地遇刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1687">28:07</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>一些阴谋论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>美国总统被刺杀的频率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>中国的刺客形象与西方的不同之处</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu2-ecn8pTATJcQuXeJhxZci-dJd.m4a" length="37781344" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:56</itunes:duration>
