    <pubDate>Mon, 24 Jun 2024 15:56:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：热干面老师（加拿大旅居十年），胡辣汤老师 （常青藤毕业，主攻南亚研究，精通印地语、韩语等）</span></p><span></span><p><span>你知道三十六计怎么翻译吗？英语词汇有哪些是拉丁词汇，法语词在英语中的含量可能高出想象，古希腊神话故事里有些什么词用到了今天？梵语词可能就藏在日常喝的矿泉水品牌中，各种专业（Domain Specific Vocabulary) 词汇怎么讲，且来听两位老师一通胡侃。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期涉及部分词汇表：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>三十六计：Thirty-Six Stratagems</span></p><span></span><p><span>涅槃：Nirvana</span></p><span></span><p><span>鹿野园： Deer Park</span></p><span></span><p><span>枝形吊灯： Chandelier</span></p><span></span><p><span>ASICS: Anima sana in corpore sano (A sound mind in a sound body)</span></p><span></span><p><span>既成事实：Fait accompli</span></p><span></span><p><span>精神病专家： Psychiatrist</span></p><span></span><p><span>孤芳自赏者：Narcissist</span></p><span></span><p><span>恋母情结： Oedipus Complex</span></p><span></span><p><span>战区： Area of Operations</span></p><span></span><p><span>直升机： Chopper</span></p><span></span><p><span>温室气体排放：Greenhouse Gas Emissions</span></p><span></span><p><span>MVP: Minimum Viable Product</span></p>]]></description>
